        "3f541413-67b8-4c65-8d71-a84071ae664f": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Mokosh Cosmetics produces exceptional natural cosmetics that captivate with their quality and selection of raw materials, texture and fragrance. The recipes of Mokosh products are the result of joint work of technologists and cosmetologists, which is why they respond so well to the real needs of customers.</p>",
