      "settings": {
        "content_subheading": "Welcome to Enhanced Aesthetix",
        "content_heading": "About Us",
        "content_description": "<p>Founded with a passion for confidence and self-care, our clinic is dedicated to delivering advanced aesthetic, skin, and laser treatments using modern technology and proven techniques. Our experienced team focuses on providing safe, personalised solutions that help clients look and feel their best.</p><p>We take pride in offering high-quality cosmetic and skincare services tailored to individual needs, combining professional expertise with premium products for long-lasting, natural-looking results.</p><p>With a growing presence and a strong commitment to excellence, our goal is simple — to provide trusted care, outstanding service, and results that truly make a difference.</p>",
        "content_subheading_2": "",
        "content_heading_2": "Services",
        "content_description_2": "<p>Our services are designed to support every stage of your skin and aesthetic journey, using advanced technology and clinically proven treatments. We offer a wide range of laser, skin, and cosmetic procedures tailored to individual needs, from rejuvenation and acne care to anti-ageing and body treatments. Each service is delivered by trained professionals who focus on safety, comfort, and achieving natural, long-lasting results that enhance your confidence and overall wellbeing.</p>",
